=== A2UI PROTOCOL SCHEMA REFERENCE ===

--- ENVELOPE SCHEMA (server_to_client.json) ---
Every message you produce must be a JSON object containing a "version" field set to "v0.9" and exactly ONE of the following keys:
- "createSurface": Initializes a new UI surface. Requires "surfaceId" (string) and "catalogId" (string). Optional: "theme" (object with "primaryColor", "iconUrl", "agentDisplayName"), "sendDataModel" (boolean, defaults to false — if true, the client sends the full data model in metadata with every action/message sent to the server).
- "updateComponents": Provides a flat list of component definitions. Requires "surfaceId" (string) and "components" (array of component objects, minItems: 1).
- "updateDataModel": Updates the data model. Requires "surfaceId" (string). Optional: "path" (JSON Pointer string, defaults to "/"), "value" (any type — if omitted, the key at "path" is removed; if "path" is omitted or "/", the entire data model is replaced).
- "deleteSurface": Removes a surface. Requires "surfaceId" (string).

No additional properties are allowed on any envelope message beyond "version" and the single message type key.

